The starter library follows the Köppen–Geiger climate families described by
Beck et al. (2023), doi:10.1038/s41597-023-02549-6. Regional references include
NOAA, the UK Met Office, AEMET (Spain), the Meteorological Service Singapore,
Japan Meteorological Agency, IMGW-PIB (Poland) and the Faroe Islands' weather
summary. See the configuration guide for the referenced climate data.

The optional online mode uses model data provided by Open-Meteo.com,
transformed into Minecraft weather.
